OL,3,AIceland votes against restarting talks
OL,4,Aon joining EU
OL,5,
OL,6,FIceland has voted against resuming
OL,7,Fmembership talks with the European
OL,8,FUnion, according to public broadcaster
OL,9,FRUV.
OL,11,FIt reported that 52.8% of the 225,031
OL,12,Fvotes cast had rejected the
OL,13,Fgovernment's proposal, while 47.2% had
OL,14,Fsaid yes. Some 12,600 votes separated
OL,15,Fthem.
OL,17,FPrime Minister Kristrun Frostadottir's
OL,18,Fcentre-left government promised to hold
OL,19,Fa referendum by 2027, but brought it
OL,20,Fforward because of international
OL,21,Ftensions, including US President Donald
OL,22,FTrump's threats against Greenland.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
